#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "a11yfy – PDF Accessibility Checker & Fixer"
msgstr "a11yfy – PDF Accessibility Checker & Fixer"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://a11yfy.com/wordpress"
msgstr "https://a11yfy.com/wordpress"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Free in-browser PDF accessibility scan (Matterhorn Protocol machine checks) and one-click PDF/UA-1 remediation via the "
"a11yfy service."
msgstr ""
"Gratis tilgængelighedsscanning af PDF-filer direkte i browseren (maskinelle kontroller i henhold til "
"Matterhorn-protokollen) og korrektion i henhold til PDF/UA-1 med et enkelt klik via a11yfy-tjenesten."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "a11yfy"
msgstr "a11yfy"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://a11yfy.com"
msgstr "https://a11yfy.com"

