msgstr "Forbindelse"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:28
msgid "Connect to a11yfy"
msgstr "Opret forbindelse til a11yfy"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:32
msgid "One click: log in or register on a11yfy.com, approve the access, done. Alternatively, paste an API key below."
msgstr ""
"Et enkelt klik: Log ind eller opret en konto på a11yfy.com, godkend adgangen – så er det klaret. Du kan også indsætte "
"en API-nøgle nedenfor."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:38
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API-nøgle"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:43
msgid "connected"
msgstr "forbundet"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:47
msgid "Disconnect (remove the stored key)"
msgstr "Afbryd forbindelsen (fjern den gemte nøgle)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:49
msgid "To replace the key, paste a new one below."
msgstr "For at erstatte nøglen skal du indsætte en ny nedenfor."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:57
#. translators: %s: link to the a11yfy account page.
msgid "Create a key on %s under Account → API keys. The key is stored encrypted and is never sent to the browser."
msgstr "Opret en nøgle på %s under Konto → API-nøgler. Nøglen gemmes i krypteret form og sendes aldrig til browseren."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:66
msgid "Status updates"
msgstr "Statusopdateringer"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:69
msgid "Instant (webhook) — a11yfy notifies this site the moment a job finishes; polling remains as a safety net."
msgstr ""
"Øjeblikkelig (webhook) — a11yfy underretter dette websted, så snart en opgave er afsluttet; polling fungerer fortsat "
"som et sikkerhedsnet."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:71
msgid ""
"Polling — the site checks job status in the background. Reconnecting via the button flow enables instant webhook "
"updates when your site is publicly reachable."
msgstr ""
"Polling — webstedet tjekker jobstatus i baggrunden. Ved at genoprette forbindelsen via knapperne får du øjeblikkelige "
"webhook-opdateringer, når dit websted er offentligt tilgængeligt."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:81
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Tilstand"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:87
msgid "new PDF uploads are made accessible automatically."
msgstr "Nye PDF-filer, der uploades, gøres automatisk tilgængelige."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:92
msgid "you pick what to fix in the Media Library or on the Dashboard."
msgstr "Du vælger selv, hvad du vil redigere i mediebiblioteket eller på kontrolpanelet."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:102
msgid "Remediation pauses when this many credits were spent in a calendar month. 0 = no cap."
msgstr "Saneringen sættes på pause, når der er brugt så mange kreditter i løbet af en kalendermåned. 0 = ingen begrænsning."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:106
msgid "Low-credit warning below"
msgstr "Advarsel om lav kreditværdighed nedenfor"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:110
msgid "Admin notice + email when the balance drops below this. 0 = off."
msgstr "Administratorbesked + e-mail, når saldoen falder under dette beløb. 0 = slået fra."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:114
msgid "Saving strategy"
msgstr "Opsparingsstrategi"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:119
msgid "Replace in place (recommended)"
msgstr "Udskift på stedet (anbefales)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:120
msgid "same URL, original kept as a backup with one-click restore."
msgstr "samme URL, hvor originalen gemmes som sikkerhedskopi med gendannelse med et enkelt klik."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:124
msgid "Conservative"
msgstr "Konservativ"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:125
msgid "the original file is never touched; links are swapped when pages render."
msgstr "Den oprindelige fil ændres aldrig; linkene udskiftes, når siderne vises."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:131
msgid "Notification email"
msgstr "Notifikations-e-mail"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:136
msgid "Low-credit and failure notifications. Empty = site admin email."
msgstr "Meddelelser om lav kredit og fejl. Tom = webstedsadministratorens e-mailadresse."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:140
msgid "On plugin deletion"
msgstr "Om sletning af plugins"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:145
msgid "Keep the remediated PDFs (recommended — they are your content)."
msgstr "Gem de korrigerede PDF-filer (anbefales — det er jo dit indhold)."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:149
msgid "Restore the original files from backup."
msgstr "Gendan de oprindelige filer fra sikkerhedskopien."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:156
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Gem indstillinger"

#: includes/class-a11yfy-api-client.php:102
msgid "The PDF file could not be read from disk."
msgstr "PDF-filen kunne ikke læses fra disken."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-api-client.php:125
msgid "No a11yfy API key configured."
msgstr "Der er ikke konfigureret nogen a11yfy-API-nøgle."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-api-client.php:185
#. translators: %d: HTTP status code.
msgid "a11yfy API error (HTTP %d)."
msgstr "a11yfy API-fejl (HTTP %d)."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-connect.php:39
#: includes/class-a11yfy-connect.php:64
msgid "You are not allowed to connect this site."
msgstr "Det er ikke tilladt at oprette forbindelse til dette websted."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:27
msgid "The attachment file is not available on the local filesystem."
msgstr "Den vedhæftede fil findes ikke på det lokale filsystem."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:33
msgid "This PDF is larger than 50 MB — above the current processing limit."
msgstr "Denne PDF-fil er større end 50 MB — hvilket overstiger den nuværende behandlingsgrænse."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:40
msgid "Not enough PHP memory to upload this PDF safely. Raise memory_limit or process a smaller file."
msgstr ""
"Der er ikke nok PHP-hukommelse til at uploade denne PDF-fil på en sikker måde. Øg værdien for `memory_limit`, eller "
"brug en mindre fil."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:46
msgid "The monthly credit cap set for this site has been reached."
msgstr "Det månedlige kreditloft for dette websted er nået."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:53
msgid "This PDF already passed the accessibility pre-check — skipping to avoid unnecessary credit use."
msgstr ""
"Denne PDF har allerede bestået forhåndskontrollen af tilgængeligheden — den springes over for at undgå unødvendig brug "
"af kredit."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:59
msgid "This exact file was already remediated."
msgstr "Netop denne fil er allerede blevet rettet."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:64
msgid "A remediation job is already running for this PDF."
msgstr "Der er allerede sat en rettelsesopgave i gang for denne PDF-fil."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-queue.php:123
msgid "[a11yfy] Low credit balance"
msgstr "[a11yfy] Lav kreditbalance"

#: includes/class-a11yfy-queue.php:126
#. translators: 1: credit balance, 2: top-up URL.
msgid ""
"Your a11yfy credit balance is down to %1$d credits. PDF remediation will stop when it reaches zero.\n"
"\n"
"Top up at: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"Din a11yfy-kreditbalance er nu nede på %1$d kreditter. PDF-korrektionen stopper, når saldoen når nul.\n"
"\n"
"Fyld op på: %2$s"

#: includes/class-a11yfy-remediate-service.php:151
msgid "The job did not finish within 2 hours. Please contact a11yfy support."
msgstr "Opgaven blev ikke afsluttet inden for 2 timer. Kontakt venligst a11yfy-supporten."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-remediate-service.php:252
msgid "The job finished but no output file was provided."
msgstr "Opgaven er afsluttet, men der blev ikke leveret nogen outputfil."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-replacer.php:41
msgid "The original file is not stored locally (offload plugin?) — not supported yet."
msgstr "Den oprindelige fil gemmes ikke lokalt (offload-plugin?) — dette understøttes endnu ikke."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-replacer.php:99
msgid "Could not download the remediated PDF from a11yfy."
msgstr "Det var ikke muligt at downloade den tilpassede PDF-fil fra a11yfy."

